    "short_description": "A combination of Action RPG and Tower Defense: slay monsters, find weapons, upgrade your armies, defend your base\u2026 Prevent humanity from extinction at the hands of monsters from Greek mythology and ancient tribes. Don't let them cross the gate, commander!",
