    "reviews": "\u201cLegendary Hoplite seems to have translated its theme in a simple but satisfying way, directly lifting imagery and creatures from Greek mythology and film adaptations. In fact, gameplay is centered on defending a gate in a choke point, so it really does call 300 to mind too.\u201d<br>TryHardGuides, Anthony Fertino<br><br>\u201cEverything I\u2019ve seen so far points to an engaging gameplay loop of taking on increasingly strong opponents, gaining more abilities to help defend against them, and getting powerful loot from each battle.\u201d<br>The Indie Informer, Jill Grodt<br><br>\u201cIt\u2019s a fun game where strategic arrangement of your units is key, especially when facing powerful bosses, such as Cerberus, Minotaurs and Hydra\u201d<br>AlphaBetaGamer, KJ Robertson<br>",
